//
// Normative rule menvcfg_cbcfe_op (src/priv/machine.adoc):
//   The Zicbom extension adds the `CBCFE` (Cache Block Clean and Flush instruction Enable) field to
//     `menvcfg`. When the `CBCFE` field is set to 1, it enables execution of the cache block clean
//     instruction (`CBO.CLEAN`) and the cache block flush instruction (`CBO.FLUSH`) in modes less
//     privileged than M. Otherwise, these instructions raise an illegal-instruction exception in
//     modes less privileged than M.
